<title>AUSTRALIA: TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN FIFTH DAY SCHEDULE.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-AUSTRALIAN OPEN FIFTH DAY SCHEDULE.</headline>
<dateline>MELBOURNE 1997-01-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Schedule of play on the fifth day of the US$7.6 million Australian Open tennis tournament on Friday (prefix denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Centre Court (2345 GMT start, Thursday)</p>
<p>Natasha Zvereva (Belarus) v 5-Anke Huber (Germany)</p>
<p>Todd Woodbridge (Australia) v MaliVai Washington (U.S.)</p>
<p>7-Thomas Enqvist (Sweden) v Sergi Bruguera (Spain)</p>
<p>Night session (0800 GMT start)</p>
<p>3-Conchita Martinez (Spain) v Asa Carlsson (Sweden)</p>
<p>Tim Henman (Britain) v 2-Michael Chang (U.S.)</p>
<p>Court One (2300 GMT start, Thursday)</p>
<p>Carlos Moya (Spain) v Bernd Karbacher (Germany)</p>
<p>1-Steffi Graf (Germany) v Ines Gorrochategui (Argentina)</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) v Dennis van Scheppingen</p>
<p>(Netherlands)</p>
<p>Court Two (2300 GMT start, Thursday)</p>
<p>Tamarine Tanasugarn (Thailand) v 7-Lindsay Davenport (U.S.)</p>
<p>14-Felix Mantilla (Spain) v Arnaud Boetsch (France)</p>
</text>
